# prohibit-grade-reservation-precedence — a single gate combines all three
# step-(1)-(3) checks on the same kind: an unguarded prohibition, a reservation
# by a human role, and a source gate requiring a grade the actor's maximal
# granted grade would otherwise satisfy. Priority selection (SPEC §7.1) runs
# `prohibited` first: it beats a grant, a maximal granted grade (L6 >= the
# gate's required L2, which step (4) would otherwise dispose `auto`), and a
# same-kind reservation that would otherwise fire at step (3). No privilege
# attenuates a prohibition.
actor bot grade L6
human legal role legal
gate  decide risk high grade L2 grant bot
prohibit deploy
reserve deploy by legal
cord  bot    -> decide
cord  decide -> master
